  "description": "This dataset comprises EEG recordings from 13 screened participants across two sessions, examining neural activity during trance channeling and resting state conditions. Each session consisted of alternating 5-minute blocks of trance channeling and rest, with three periods per condition. The study investigates the neurophysiological correlates of trance channeling through continuous EEG monitoring.",
